# build output
*.o
dist/

# runtime logs
chinese.log

# editor / OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Experimental fonts (NOT shipped)
#
# Only fonts/WenQuanYi Bitmap Song 14px.ttf is loaded at runtime (see FONT_SRC
# in the Makefile). The other faces kept on disk for experiments are large
# (Noto Sans SC ~17 MB, WQY other pixel sizes ~30 MB total) and would add ~77 MB
# to the repository for no runtime benefit, so the whole fonts/ directory is
# ignored and only the two shipped files are re-included.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
fonts/*
!fonts/WenQuanYi Bitmap Song 14px.ttf
!fonts/WenQuanYi-LICENSE.txt

# Superseded license file: the shipped font is GPL-2.0 + font embedding
# exception (see fonts/WenQuanYi-LICENSE.txt), not OFL. The OFL text belonged to
# fonts tried during development (Cubic 11 / M+ FONTS) and is no longer
# applicable.
OFL.txt
fonts/OFL.txt
Cubic_11.ttf
fonts/Cubic_11.ttf

# NOTE: plugin.dll is intentionally NOT ignored -- this repo ships a prebuilt
# DLL so an experimental build can be dropped into mods/chinese/ without a
# toolchain. Rebuild it with `make` if you change plugin.c.
